    "preamble": "S.Albert Arulraj vs The Secretary To Government on 12 September, 2022 Author: S.M. Subramaniam Bench: S.M.Subramaniam W.P.No.27 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 12.09.2022 Coram : The Honourable Mr. Justice S.M.Subramaniam W.P.No.27606 of 2016 and W.M.P.No.23783 of 2016 1.S.Albert Arulraj 2.M.Kumar 3.H.Ramachandran 4.T.Jaganathan 5.R.Manikandan 6.R.Ramamoorty 7.R.Murugan 8.G.Ramesh 9.M.B.Senthil Ramkumar 10.E.Krishnan 11.T.Ayyappan 12.N.Venkatachalam 13.T.Ravimohan 14.R.Venkatesh ... Pet Vs. 1.The Secretary to Government, Health and Family Welfare Department, Secretariat, Fort St. George, Chennai 600 009. 2.The Director of Public Health and Preventive Medicine, 359, Anna Salai, Chennai 600 006. 3.The Commissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Chennai 600 006. ... Resp https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis S.Albert Arulraj vs The Secretary To Government on 12 September, 2022 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/94732257/ 1 Page 1 of 4 W.P.No.27 Prayer: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of for issuance of a Writ of Mandamus, directing the 2nd respondent to orders to issue Certificate for Food Inspector Training completed by petitioners prior to 05.08.2011 and consequently directing the 3rd respondent to appoint the petitioner to the post of Food Safety Offi par with their juniors on advent of Food Safety and Standard Act 200 on 05.08.2011 with all consequential and other attendant benefits ba the Government Letter No.28698/M1/2014-2 dated 02.06.2015 and subsequent reminder in Letter No.32122/M1/2015-1 dated 05.11.2015 issued by the 1st respondent dated 02.02.2015.",
